{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> CLOWNCORE is a stealth horror game. Every 7 years, the mysterious carnival appears. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sneak into this twisted place and find out how to stop Gambino the clown, the boss of this nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sneak Around (Stealth Gameplay):</strong> This isn't a game where you run in guns blazing. You'll need to be super quiet and smart. Every shadow is your friend!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hide Anywhere (Dynamic Hiding System):</strong> See a dark corner? An empty barrel? You can probably hide there! Our hiding system lets you quickly disappear into the environment, making it crucial for escaping danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fight Back (Close Combat with Breakable Weapons):</strong> Sometimes, sneaking just isn't enough. If you get caught, you'll have to fight for your life. You'll find weapons, but be careful \u2013 they can break! So, pick your fights wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scary Clown Enemies:</strong>\u00a0Clowns!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncover Dark Secrets:</strong> The carnival holds many dark truths. As you explore, you'll piece together clues and solve puzzles to learn why this curse happens and how to truly stop Gambino.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Complete Challenges for Achievements:</strong> Take on special in-game challenges to prove your skills and unlock cool achievements.  </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3654810?t=1752159562","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3654810?t=1752159562","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654810/1697a6a89097cdb28b8b71d793baea99a55fd182/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752159562","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654810/1697a6a89097cdb28b8b71d793baea99a55fd182/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752159562","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> CLOWNCORE is a stealth horror game. Every 7 years, the mysterious carnival appears. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sneak into this twisted place and find out how to stop Gambino the clown, the boss of this nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sneak Around (Stealth Gameplay):</strong> This isn't a game where you run in guns blazing. You'll need to be super quiet and smart. Every shadow is your friend!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hide Anywhere (Dynamic Hiding System):</strong> See a dark corner? An empty barrel? You can probably hide there! Our hiding system lets you quickly disappear into the environment, making it crucial for escaping danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fight Back (Close Combat with Breakable Weapons):</strong> Sometimes, sneaking just isn't enough. If you get caught, you'll have to fight for your life. You'll find weapons, but be careful \u2013 they can break! So, pick your fights wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scary Clown Enemies:</strong>\u00a0Clowns!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncover Dark Secrets:</strong> The carnival holds many dark truths. As you explore, you'll piece together clues and solve puzzles to learn why this curse happens and how to truly stop Gambino.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Complete Challenges for Achievements:</strong> Take on special in-game challenges to prove your skills and unlock cool achievements.  </p></li></ul>","developers":["NickNickolas"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654810/8f6da19f80f04312e3ee55e2ac125813f83ca8ad/header.jpg?t=1752159562","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257164546,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164546/movie480.mp4?t=1751608448","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164546/movie_max.mp4?t=1751608448"},"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257164546/e1caa6259888e6432a639b358bb25764cc60d884/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751608448","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164546/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1751608448","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164546/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1751608448"}}],"name":"CLOWNCORE","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-11400H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The game was tested on a laptop with the Geforce 3060 GPU</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["NickNickolas"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"7 Aug, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://sha